h","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_11","text":"I can't even!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_12","text":":D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_13","text":"Thank you!","jump":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_18"},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_14","text":"Aw man, so you agree with Belorta?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_15","text":"Still though, I like this one,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_16","text":"so I'm going to keep it for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_17","text":"Hehehe.","jump":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_18"},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_18","text":"Anyhoo, I'm dying to go back to Snowfield one of these days.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_19","text":"We had such a great time there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_20","text":"The hot springs were out of this world,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_21","text":"and the food was spectacular as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_22","text":"Oh yeah, and it was a total blast skipping stones!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_23","text":"Rattling off all the fun things we did","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_24","text":"only makes me more eager to return.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_25","text":"How about you, Old-Timer?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_26","text":"Do you want to go there again?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_27","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_28","text":"So,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_29","text":"what did you have the most fun doing at Snowfield?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_30","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_30","text":"Anything that I did with you.","jump":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_32"},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_31","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_31","text":"It's hard to name one.","jump":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_33"},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_32","text":"Ha, same!","jump":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_35"},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_33","text":"Yeah,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_34","text":"that makes sense.","jump":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_35"},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_35","text":"Let's go there again the second we have a chance to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_36","text":"It's a deal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_37","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_38","text":"Well, I better get back to cleaning the Toy Store, then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mica_snowbuddy_01_39","text":"I'll text you later.","jump":null}],"chat":true}